## 7. Acceptance criteria

- Four live sites: `curveRcore`, `curveRfreq`, `curveRbayes` newly built; `curveRweights` rebuilt
  to reflect the Issue-1 API and vignette.
- Consistent theme/navbar across all four (visibly a family).
- Each reference index is grouped (not one flat alphabetical list) and complete — no exported
  function missing a help page; `pkgdown::check_pkgdown()` clean per repo.
- Each README opens with the ecosystem banner pointing at the hub URL.
- Bayesian/weights vignettes knit in CI via the documented Stan strategy.
- Cross-package `@seealso` links resolve on the rendered pages.

**Output needed by Issue 3:** four working spoke sites + finalized per-package reference groupings,
which the hub aggregates and re-uses.
